  "dateReleased": "2026-07-18",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.0: fixes a discovery-state race where an orphaned scheduled callback from a superseded run could corrupt a fresh run's state, adds a staleness timeout so a stuck discovery run can self-recover, removes the unreliable auto-restart of Discovery from the app's updated() lifecycle, adds a validation-first LAN rediscovery pass, adds per-row removal of stale saved-table entries, sorts diagnostic tables by IP address, replaces the Master Switch's free-text colour field with a proper colour-map picker, adds parent-app null guards and duration handling consistency across all child drivers, and replaces silent exception handling with debug-level logging throughout.",
